00:14:17.495 --> 00:14:18.554
It's just strange.

00:14:18.554 --> 00:14:19.874
The A and D are strange.

00:14:20.474 --> 00:14:22.175
The B would be your correct answer.

00:14:22.724 --> 00:14:24.805
So this is the idea behind electrolytes.

00:14:24.814 --> 00:14:27.574
So that way you can see how
many ions you have in solution.

